### 1.登录接口（先运行此接口获取token）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2.查询当前登录用户信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user
token: {{token}}

### 3.分页查询饮食记录
GET http://localhost:8080/api/diet/list?pageNum=1&pageSize=10
token: {{token}}

### 4.新增饮食记录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/diet/add
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "foodName": "鸡胸肉",
  "calorie": 120,
  "eatTime": "2026-07-03",
  "userId": 1
}

### 5.删除指定id饮食记录（末尾数字替换为实际数据id）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/diet/delete/1
token: {{token}}